# Input

```svelte
{#await thePromise then theValue}the value is {theValue}{/await}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1 +1,3 @@
-{#await thePromise then theValue}the value is {theValue}{/await}
+{#await thePromise then theValue}
+    the value is {theValue}
+{/await}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#await thePromise then theValue}
    the value is {theValue}
{/await}
```
